<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Macmed says in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Macmed says in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macmed Health Care Ltd said on Thursday it was in talks, which if successfully concluded, may have an effect on the price of its shares.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
